<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-10-30T16:06:18.086Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:06:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Chhattisgarh uncovered a major Maoist weapons cache in Sukma, seizing two IEDs and explosives, while LG Manoj Sinha chaired high-level security meetings in both Kashmir and the Kashmir division, directing sustained action against terror modules and tightening counter-infiltration grids. In Manipur, a shutdown began in a district after two Kuki youths went missing, the state announced ex-gratia for families of 32 Kuki-Zo civilians killed, and a former chief minister accused BJP leaders of orchestrating his ouster and ongoing violence. The Mirwaiz of Kashmir called for the release of political prisoners and restoration of civil liberties, urging justice and trust rebuilding. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/india-increases-growth-forecast-for-fiscal-year/a-79798971?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQX2NlUWJ0R2Zqb3o3am9mVjQwNFF2bG8yTFRLZnAzc3J0SE9MRGhNV25ZNUlQOFpaNG9YR3VGUkhIX25KYmtXZTRUUmJudk9TdUtGZWNqWkN4Um5FMFFwT29pVjlBYmJhZlhpRml3YkhSMk5MWUdjSGtmQ18wRGRqYlMxdllhNWRhV1pHSnJzUURUanZkUzlzeGRnR3UzYkZxS0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Life&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Organiser&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxPR1NkWV9lM3VIUWVuUDFzWlpfblVLUzJLSFJhdVI1S1BLYlhoRXpwUldNM01aRzBOTnY0QldzTVA5QlZsblJZM1FjQWxfckNaZG9pWjNzQ0QydHRuUVlzOExaRjVtV2tPQV9lM2IxRjI4YzRIUzc1UWlVZmFFUXVuOFdRTnpTSEsxaEhEXzdJWWV6Ym5ZMXk0czNWSEJ1dm5RTERjdjM3OTV4eWw4UmdpNWxXQm1IZDhVOU93M1lTNEZrQ3plR09v?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Life&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxPaE5w